    "html": "<p>Uranium-238 <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\left ( _{\\, \\, \\,92}^{238}\\textrm{U} \\right )\"></span> first decays through alpha decay into element P and then element P decays further through beta-minus decay into element Q. What are the neutron number and the nucleon number of element Q?</p>\n\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td>\n<p><strong>Neutron number of Q</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><strong>Nucleon number of Q</strong></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"A\">\n<td><strong>A.</strong></td>\n<td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"143\"></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"234\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"B\">\n<td><strong>B.</strong></td>\n<td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"145\"></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"234\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"C\">\n<td><strong>C.</strong></td>\n<td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"143\"></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"233\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"D\">\n<td><strong>D.</strong></td>\n<td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"145\"></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"233\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>"
